[en.FOCUS_C12_DEVELOPING_MUDFROG_MARSH]
Developing Mudfrog Marsh

[en.FOCUS_C12_DEVELOPING_MUDFROG_MARSH_desc]
The Mudfrog Marsh was previously considered unsuitable for pony habitation, with rumors of giant beasts residing there. The area is filled with swampy waters emitting greenish foam, dense mangroves, and overgrown vines, providing a habitat for numerous frogs, which is how the area got its name. However, after geological survey teams discovered abundant oil reserves beneath the marsh, we can no longer ignore this desolate place. Only the most resilient ponies from the rock farm can undertake the arduous task of extracting resources from here.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_DEVELOPING_MUDFROG_MARSH]
开发泥蛙沼

[zh.FOCUS_C12_DEVELOPING_MUDFROG_MARSH_desc]
泥蛙沼泽此前并不是一个适合小马居住的地方，甚至有传言这里有巨型猛兽生活着，这里到处是泛着发绿泡沫的沼泽水，遍布红树林和其疯长的枝蔓，大量青蛙生活在此处，也正是这里得名的缘故。但是当地理勘探队发觉沼泽底下蕴藏的大量石油之后，我们没法再对这个荒芜的地方置之不理，也只有最刚毅的采石农场小马可以承担开采这里的艰巨任务。

